<Base title="About | Secure Scaffolding" description="Secure Scaffolding is an Australian-owned Sydney scaffolding company with a track record spanning major NSW projects." current="about"><main><PageHeader eyebrow="Our story" title="Experience you can build on." intro="Proudly Australian-owned and based in Sydney, Secure Scaffolding has delivered dependable access solutions since 1996." /><section class="section" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="lead">Secure Scaffolding Pty Ltd was founded in 1996 as a labour hire company with two crews of scaffolders. By early 1997, we were entrusted with the Wood Chopping Arena and Horticultural Building at the New Sydney Showgrounds for Hansen Yuncken, as well as scaffold and rigging works for AW Edwards.</p><p class="lead">By 2000, we had completed all unit blocks in the Olympic Village for Mirvac Constructions. Our team grew to 40 scaffolders, including eight contracted to Nussli for the Volleyball Stadium at Bondi Beach during the Sydney Olympics.</p><p class="lead">After the Olympics, we continued projects for Boral, PCH, Mirvac and Multiplex, including the retrofit of the athletes’ village with Newington Homes. In 2001 we expanded into scaffolding hire and transport through Secure Domestic Safety Access Pty Ltd.</p><p class="lead">In 2024, we rebranded as Secure Scaffolding Services Pty Ltd, continuing the same commitment to reliable, professional service while steadily expanding our capabilities.</p></div><div class="list"><div class="list-row">1996 <span>Company founded</span></div><div class="list-row">1997 <span>New Sydney Showgrounds & AW Edwards</span></div><div class="list-row">2000 <span>Sydney Olympics projects</span></div><div class="list-row">2001 <span>Hire & transport services added</span></div><div class="list-row">2024 <span>Rebranded as Secure Scaffolding Services</span></div></div></div></section><section class="section band"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#d7f54b">Project record</div><h2>Work that tells the story.</h2></div><p class="lead">From bridges and hospitals to commercial and residential sites, our experience spans the environments where safe access matters most.</p></div><ProjectGallery /></div></section></main></Base>
